      "message": "The bug report says:\n\n\u003e signed integer overflow: -2147483648 - 1424 cannot be represented in type \u0027int\u0027\n\nThis means `rc-\u003eavg_frame_bandwidth` is -2147483648. If `rc-\u003eavg_frame_bandwidth` should be nonnegative, then things have already gone wrong, and casting a negative `rc-\u003eavg_frame_bandwidth` to `int64_t` does not help.",
